```mdl
verdict F-1.3: Every feed already behaves as if it had no options (indexing on, only the host's limits), but there is no options column to be NULL.
  status: partial
  evidence:
    [github:dxos/edge/packages/services/db-service/src/worker/feed-space/feed-space.ts#FeedSpace._getMaxQueueSize,
